139,963
Fixed nine cases to accept optional fields, reordered candidates and unspecified body names while retaining wrong-answer rejection. Earlier case expectations are unchanged.

Checks: **190 tests passed**, type checking passed, stub **70/70 MET**.

Real CLI results:

| New case | Result |
|---|---|
| A5-exact-callees | MET |
| A5-exact-not-found | MET |
| A5-exact-depth-stop | MET |
| A2-inline-generator-owner | MET |
| A2-same-name-helper-fake | MET |
| A2-effect-step-ambiguous | MET |
| A2-shorter-route-down | NOT MET |
| A2-shorter-route-down-reversed | MET |
| A2-shorter-route-up | NOT MET |
| A2-shorter-route-up-reversed | MET |

The remaining mismatches are tool defects under A2:

- **Down:** missing `routeLeaf → routeTail` at `down.ts:7 → 8`.
- **Up:** missing `routeTail → routeLeaf` at `up.ts:5 → 4`.

Both links are within depth three through the shorter route. The tool suppresses them with `seen` after expanding the longer route, violating “a known link within the depth is missing.”

Changed files, full mismatches and verification are recorded in [COVERAGE.md](/home/smoke01/dev/ancient-games/code_map/eval/COVERAGE.md:199). These Codex-written checks validate fixture behavior; broader correctness remains unmeasured.
